{"node":{"id":"MONDO:0012997","label":"cholestasis-pigmentary retinopathy-cleft palate syndrome","definition":"Cholestasis- pigmentary retinopathy- cleft palate is a syndrome of multiple congenital malformations, characterized by an association of cleft lip and palate, patchy pigmentary retinopathy (cat's paw), obstructive liver disease (cholestasis, portal hypertension etc.) and obstructive renal disease (ectopic ureteric insertion, obstruction, vesicouretral reflux and hydronephrosis). Gastrointestinal tract involvement (malrotation, gastresophageal reflux etc.) and cardiac involvement (coarctation of aorta, pulmonary artery stenosis etc) have also been reported. An overlap with Kabuki syndrome is debated.","synonyms":["Hardikar syndrome"],"xrefs":["GARD:0009280","MEDGEN:208652","MESH:C535632","OMIM:301068","OMIM:612726","Orphanet:1415","SCTID:720636001","UMLS:C0795969"],"parents":[],"parents_labels":{},"children":[],"children_labels":{},"in_core":false,"cluster_id":null,"is_group":false,"n_genes":1,"n_phenotypes":80,"mechanism_classes":[]},"genes":[{"id":"e_20d18899c9db","source":"MONDO:0012997","target":"MED12","type":"caused_by","evidence":[{"db":"Orphanet","origin":"Orphanet","record":"ORPHA:1415","level":"curated","date":"2026-06-23","url":"https://www.orpha.net/en/disease/detail/1415","confidence":0.95,"snippet":"Disease-causing germline mutation(s) (loss of function) in (Assessed) — mediator complex subunit 12"},{"db":"HPO","origin":"OMIM","record":"OMIM:301068","level":"curated","date":"2026-09-02","confidence":0.9,"url":"https://omim.org/entry/301068","snippet":"MED12 is annotated as disease gene of OMIM:301068 (HPO genes_to_phenotype, OMIM-derived)"}],"contradicting":[],"confidence":0.95,"independent_sources":["OMIM","Orphanet"],"level":"curated"}],"phenotypes":[{"edge":{"id":"e_bcf410554716","source":"MONDO:0012997","target":"HP:0033149","type":"has_phenotype","evidence":[{"db":"HPO","origin":"OMIM","record":"OMIM:301068 · PMID:18348269","url":"https://